          "block_type": "minecraft:lantern",
          "position": [-3007, 72, -5570],
          "description": "The fence-post lantern exists at its expected position (scene integrity check)"
        },
        {
          "rule_type": "position_inside_box",
          "min_corner": [-3008, 70, -5571],
          "max_corner": [-3002, 76, -5565],
          "description": "Player has navigated within 2 blocks of the lantern area (covers fence-post lantern at -3007,72,-5570 and hanging lantern at -3004,73,-5567)"
        }
      ],
      "completion_description": "Both rules must be satisfied: the lantern block must exist at (-3007,72,-5570), AND the player must walk into the bounding box near the lanterns. The player spawns at approximately (-3010,71,-5573), which is outside the box — they must walk ~3 blocks toward the lanterns to enter the box at (-3008,70,-5571) to (-3002,76,-5565)."
    }
  ]
}
```

This ensures the player must actually move toward the lanterns to complete the milestone. The box starts ~2 blocks from spawn, requiring intentional navigation.

